    "inline python scan",
    "json decision"
  ],
  "potential": "medium",
  "next_gate": "Stay I3 by rules (data/promotion-rules.json, security track). Deny-only guard in the worker lanes; tests/test_dcg_fail_safe.py keeps ordinary commands allowed when dcg is missing. The 2026-11-10 sandlock trial classified 12/12 destructive and 8/8 ordinary cases cleanly.",
